ished as one of the major international cue sports, governed by the World Snooker Tour.\\n\\nThe objective in a snooker game is to ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cueballchronicles.com/post/snooker-rules-and-regulations-a-comprehensive-guide-to-the-rules-governing-the-game\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d21\"},\"ref\":\"d21\",\"snippet\":\" ... Snookered After A Foul |\\n\\n| |\\n\\nAfter a foul, if the cue-ball is snookered (see Section 2, Rule 17), the referee shall state FREE BALL. |\\n\\n| |\\n\\n(a) |\\n\\nIf the player next in turn elects to play the next stroke:\\n\\n(i) he may nominate any ball as the ball on, but ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.snookerusa.com/aboutsnooker/rules3.php\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d22\"},\"ref\":\"d22\",\"snippet\":\" ... Find out more\\nAccept All Cookies \\nOnly Essential\\nScullion qualified as a grade three referee back in 1984, working his way up the ranks to join the pro scene in 1999.\\nAnthony Hamilton\\n\\nWorld Snooker Tour\\nhttps://www.wst.tv › players\\nHamilton is one of snooker's great ... \",\"title\":\"https://wst.tv/leo-scullion\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d4\"},\"ref\":\"d4\",\"snippet\":\" ... O'Sullivan and referee Marteel had several heated exchanges during the session and did not shake hands afterwards. Marteel issued a formal warning over a gesture O'Sullivan made near the end of the eighth frame after failing to escape from a snooker, but O'Sullivan denied any ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_World_Snooker_Championship\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"